@WS.Backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5009

### Hent alle medlemmer fra databasen
GET http://localhost:5009/api/members
Accept: application/json

### Opret et nyt medlem i databasen
POST http://localhost:5009/api/members
Content-Type: application/json


{
  "id": 0,
  "name": "Amina",
  "phone": "12345678",
  "email": "amina@example.com"
}


### Find et bestemt medlem
GET http://localhost:5009/api/members/Amina
Accept: application/json
